= Project sublimis scope
*core idea*
- online dnd platform
  - live campaigns on virtual terrain
  - live updating characters, even a move at once mode 

*implementation*
- frontend made using react + typescript + tailwind 
- frontend makes api calls to backend RESTful API to handle all major button presses and events
- backend then sometimes makes calls to the database in postgreSQL for storing and retrieval of information
- for live editing/sharing part use websockets instead of rest api for fast tcp response

*colour palette*
- i don't know yet. Hopefully something cool with some cool fantasy font
